#==============================================================================================
#
#   calculated_style_value_1 - CalculatedStyleValue: type arithmetic and simplification helpers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/CalculatedStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-228) and the inline
#       members of CalculatedStyleValue.h they belong with: CalculationContext::for_property,
#       "add the types" / "multiply the types", the simplify_* templates (which take the node
#       class's `create` as a function pointer, since a generic body cannot name T::create),
#       clamping and censoring of numeric values and reify_children.
#       The `visit`s over CalculationNode::NumericValue (a Variant of Number, Angle, Flex,
#       Frequency, Length, Percentage, Resolution and Time) are the css_numeric_value_* helpers
#       at the top.
